@page "/"

<PageTitle>CardTrader</PageTitle>

<div class="ct-hero mb-4">
    <h1 class="mb-1">CardTrader</h1>
    <p class="lead mb-0">Relationship-based access control with OpenFGA (Zanzibar) — proof of concept</p>
</div>

<p class="text-muted mb-4">
    This PoC demonstrates fine-grained, relationship-based authorization applied to a trading-card
    platform. Every permission check is delegated to an OpenFGA store — no if-statements in service
    or UI code. Use the navigation to explore cards, build rosters, propose trades, and model
    parent-managed delegation.
</p>

<div class="row g-3">
    <div class="col-12 col-md-4">
        <div class="card h-100">
            <div class="card-body">
                <h5 class="card-title">
                    <span class="bi bi-credit-card-fill-nav-menu" aria-hidden="true" style="filter:invert(1) brightness(0.4); margin-right:.4rem;"></span>
                    Cards
                </h5>
                <p class="card-text text-muted">Browse the card catalogue. Ownership and rarity access are enforced per-instance via FGA tuples.</p>
                <a href="cards" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">View Cards</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="col-12 col-md-4">
        <div class="card h-100">
            <div class="card-body">
                <h5 class="card-title">
                    <span class="bi bi-collection-fill-nav-menu" aria-hidden="true" style="filter:invert(1) brightness(0.4); margin-right:.4rem;"></span>
                    Rosters
                </h5>
                <p class="card-text text-muted">Create public or private rosters. Visibility and edit rights are separate FGA relations.</p>
                <a href="rosters" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">View Rosters</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="col-12 col-md-4">
        <div class="card h-100">
            <div class="card-body">
                <h5 class="card-title">
                    <span class="bi bi-arrow-left-right-nav-menu" aria-hidden="true" style="filter:invert(1) brightness(0.4); margin-right:.4rem;"></span>
                    Trades
                </h5>
                <p class="card-text text-muted">Propose and accept trades. Only the card owner may offer; only the recipient may accept.</p>
                <a href="trades" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">View Trades</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
